  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.27 Service-connected disability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.27 “Service-connected disability” means an injury, illness, or disability determined by the United States Department of Veteran Affairs to have been incurred in or aggravated by military service. The term includes “service-connected injury.”\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.26)\n\nRev. 401.28 “Solar energy system” means “solar energy system” as defined in RSA 72:61.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.27); ss by #13943-B, eff 4-27-24",
